  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - Hum, this...
  - This is the gift I gave Selene on her birthday! My hand drawn <color=#FF00FF>portrait</color>
    of her.
  - So <color=yellow>that's how she looked like...</color> How could i forget?
  - I think I know where you found this. I know what happened, why I tried to erase
    everything from my mind.
